## 3. Sample Itinerary

| Day | Morning | Afternoon | Evening |
|-----|---------|-----------|---------|
| **Dec 5** | Arrive, check‑in at Hotel Amsterdam Center | Explore Dam Square & Royal Palace | Dinner at a canal‑side restaurant |
| **Dec 6** | Rijksmuseum | Lunch in the museum café | Evening canal cruise |
| **Dec 7** | Anne Frank House | Walk through Jordaan | Visit the Jordaan market |
